    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "839b64e4-6177-430a-b5dc-2c0102fc3f7f",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:15:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-12-31T06:42:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "My previous startups were all bootstrapped, and I’d drawn the mentality of “bootstrapping is virtuous, VC money is poison” from the Indie Hackers crowd. But Manifold made much more sense as a funded startup, and it seemed like part of a lifelong dream, to walk the path of a “proper startup founder”",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "My previous startups were all bootstrapped, and I’d drawn the mentality of “bootstrapping is virtuous, VC money is poison” from the Indie Hackers crowd. But Manifold made much more sense as a funded startup, and it seemed like part of a lifelong dream, to walk the path of a “proper startup founder”",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "2047c145-8401-441f-9d3e-aec6185c0b68",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:16:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-12-31T06:43:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Since raising Manifold’s Seed and Seed+ round, as well as getting a few six-figure grants, fundraising seems much less mysterious to me now. Fundamentally it’s not that different than applying to jobs. Work your network, write a resume, line up a bunch of interviews, and negotiate your value.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Since raising Manifold’s Seed and Seed+ round, as well as getting a few six-figure grants, fundraising seems much less mysterious to me now. Fundamentally it’s not that different than applying to jobs. Work your network, write a resume, line up a bunch of interviews, and negotiate your value.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "782775cf-97fe-4d8d-897d-e6c99050a8c9",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:18:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-12-31T06:44:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Beyond giving me the confidence that raising money is a thing I can personally do, fundraising taught me how money flows in the startup ecosystem. This then helps me step back and understand the pain points for things like ",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Beyond giving me the confidence that raising money is a thing I can personally do, fundraising taught me how money flows in the startup ecosystem. This then helps me step back and understand the pain points for things like ",
            "href": null
          },
          {
            "type": "mention",
            "mention": {
              "type": "page",
              "page": {
                "id": "86fa1c83-489d-42bf-9668-0682f99607c7"
              }
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Why impact certs might be really good",
            "href": "https://app.notion.com/p/86fa1c83489d42bf96680682f99607c7"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": " — a proposal only made sense after developing a practical knowledge (as opposed to book knowledge) of equity.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
