    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "a30daa71-c983-4352-8a81-444b337cd5d9",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:21:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-12-31T06:27:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "The purpose of raising all this money for Manifold was to expand our team. (Headcount is basically the only significant expense in most software startups). Luckily for us, our user demographic includes a lot of software engineer-types, so it wasn’t a very hard sell to find people to join our team.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "The purpose of raising all this money for Manifold was to expand our team. (Headcount is basically the only significant expense in most software startups). Luckily for us, our user demographic includes a lot of software engineer-types, so it wasn’t a very hard sell to find people to join our team.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "81d59a17-6e15-4f54-96ed-edb0af5f3403",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:30:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-12-31T06:44:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "At Streamlit, I’ve found candidates, interviewed them, and sold them on joining my team — so I’ve had some experience with the different pieces involved with hiring. But hiring Manifold’s first engineers was very different, as my cofounders and I have the ultimate responsibility for the hire/no-hire decision.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "At Streamlit, I’ve found candidates, interviewed them, and sold them on joining my team — so I’ve had some experience with the different pieces involved with hiring. But hiring Manifold’s first engineers was very different, as my cofounders and I have the ultimate responsibility for the hire/no-hire decision.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "8ead2031-b2d7-4fe9-9ddc-bd527b2305e9",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:23:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-12-31T06:39:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "I hate saying “no” to people. This can be good in some contexts; I think people generally find me nice and approachable, and I’m pretty good with moving forward with candidates we’re excited about. But with hiring, I actually need to say “sorry, we can’t give you this thing you really want”.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "I hate saying “no” to people. This can be good in some contexts; I think people generally find me nice and approachable, and I’m pretty good with moving forward with candidates we’re excited about. But with hiring, I actually need to say “sorry, we can’t give you this thing you really want”.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
