    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "c6de13e7-0433-467a-95b7-a90096c30f04",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:48:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2022-12-31T06:54:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Each one only works with the other, in kind of a cold-start problem. The guests want to know where you’re going and what you’re doing; the venue depends on where the people are and what you want to do; and the itinerary needs to fit the interests of the guests and the fruits of the locale.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Each one only works with the other, in kind of a cold-start problem. The guests want to know where you’re going and what you’re doing; the venue depends on where the people are and what you want to do; and the itinerary needs to fit the interests of the guests and the fruits of the locale.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "object": "block",
      "id": "2a5f85d0-a4a7-42cb-aa48-6c6240b9e60d",
      "parent": {
        "type": "page_id",
        "page_id": "13171fab-201c-4388-b062-04238cd16264"
      },
      "created_time": "2022-12-31T06:54:00.000Z",
      "last_edited_time": "2024-04-02T15:37:00.000Z",
      "created_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "last_edited_by": {
        "object": "user",
        "id": "00c350d3-9f7b-4bc1-b27d-24e15ac5139f"
      },
      "has_children": false,
      "in_trash": false,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "I’m especially proud because Mexifold was fairly groundbreaking, de novo innovation where I didn’t have an existing example to work on (the closest were my previous New York hacker house, and the Bahamas trip). Also, a lot of small decisions I made (such as room choices and having common areas) I think played out quite well. It bonded together our team and our community; created a template for future offsites; and formed the kind of company that I myself would want to work at.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "I’m especially proud because Mexifold was fairly groundbreaking, de novo innovation where I didn’t have an existing example to work on (the closest were my previous New York hacker house, and the Bahamas trip). Also, a lot of small decisions I made (such as room choices and having common areas) I think played out quite well. It bonded together our team and our community; created a template for future offsites; and formed the kind of company that I myself would want to work at.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
